## Project Structure

```text
26INF1103P5-2/
├── .env                        # Local environment variables (API keys) — not committed
├── .env.example                # Template for environment variables
├── .gitignore                  # Git ignore file (cache, virtualenv, secrets, generated files)
├── requirements.txt            # Python package dependencies
├── Dockerfile                  # Container build instructions for Docker
├── update.ps1                  # PowerShell script to build/update Docker image
├── README.me                   # Project documentation
├── ProjectInitialDetails.md    # Problem statement, users, and business rules
│
├── src/                        # Main application source code
│   ├── main.py                 # Application entry point and workflow orchestration
│   │
│   ├── model/                  # Data schemas and validation
│   │   └── handover_model.py   # Pydantic schemas and validation functions for handovers
│   │
│   ├── modules/                # Core domain modules and business logic
│   │   ├── input_handler.py    # User input prompt, file validation, and PII detection
│   │   ├── gemini_router.py    # Gemini LLM communication, JSON sanitization & error handling
│   │   ├── logic_manager.py    # Handover completeness verification and deadline sorting
│   │   ├── data_manager.py     # Local JSON persistence (saving and querying handovers)
│   │   └── output.py           # Formats terminal output and writes summary .txt files
│   │
│   └── utils/                  # Shared utilities and configurations
│       ├── __init__.py
│       ├── gemini_client.py    # Gemini API client initialization and automatic retries
│       ├── llm_prompt.py       # LLM prompt templates and extraction rules
│       └── logger.py           # Application logging configuration
│
└── data/                       # Application runtime data
    ├── handovers/              # Sample/input handover .txt files
    │   └── handover.txt
    ├── summaries/              # Generated handover summary text files (gitignored)
    └── handovers.json          # Persistent JSON storage for handover records (gitignored)
```

#installing of library from requirement.txt
- Any library or package you want to use please put into requirement.txt 
so it doesnt break each of our eniviornment when we are trying to intergrate 

- run this command in your CLI ( for python virtual eniviornment users )
py -m pip install -r requirements.txt

- run this command in your cli ( for non venv users )
pip install -r requirements.txt

# powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File ".\update.ps1" - TO RUN THIS COMMAND IN POWERSHELL TO PULL 
AND BUILD THE DOCKER IMAGE

# to RUN PROGRAM USING DOCKER - docker run --rm -it --env-file .env handover-app

# Alternative command : docker run --rm -it --env-file .env -v "${PWD}/data:/app/data" handover-app (saved handovers will disappear when the 
container stops, so taking over finds nothing)